  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- GeoIP & Geosite\r\n  - Finally! Add `geoip:<country>` and `geosite:<tag>` rules support (like `geoip:ru` or `geosite:google`). Rules taken from [sing-geosite](https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-geosite)\r\n  - Automatically fetch remote .srs rule-sets and cache them locally so startup stays fast\r\n- Proxy Modes\r\n  - Add proxy type setting (Local / System) to toggle your system proxy automatically when you don't want to use TUN (via sing-box ofc), default still on local\r\n- TUI & Shortcuts\r\n  - Move search and error messages to the bottom line like in vim\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Routing & Rules\r\n  - Don't trip over spaces in app paths, Windows .exe names, or wildcard domains\r\n  - Fetch remote .srs rule-sets through your active proxy connection if direct access to GitHub is blocked\r\n- Connections & Probing\r\n  - Latency probes now properly treat HTTP errors as failures instead of reporting fake successs\r\n  - Restore default host fallback for HTTP transport when host header is empty\r\n  - Improve DNS handling and settings reload\r\n- System & Imports\r\n  - Catch broken credentials earlier when importing configs\r\n  - Use fixed temporary files and clean up sockets properly on exit\r\n\r\n### ♻️ Refactoring\r\n\r\n- Delete out legacy WireGuard outbound hacks and ancient migration code\r\n- Better download cancellation when subscription fetch fails\r\n- Simplify daemon lifecycle, os matching, and remove duplicate code\r\n\r\nFull Changelog: [v1.8.1...v1.9.0](https://github.com/luynrs/justray/compare/v1.8.1...v1.9.0)\r\n",
